xample-input-5\", \"labelEn\": \"Other Expenses\", \"labelFr\": \"Other Expenses\", \"stepName\": \"Household Expenses\", \"labelOverride\": null}], \"hideEmpty\": true, \"workflowId\": 21, \"emptyFallback\": {\"en\": \"Not provided\", \"fr\": \"Non fourni\"}}','2025-10-07 13:36:45','2025-10-07 13:36:45'),(1580,114,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Apply for your Passport\", \"fr\": \"Demandez votre passeport\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-10-07 13:46:05','2025-10-07 13:46:05'),(1581,114,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"This workflow demonstrates how the intake editor can be used to create custom forms.\", \"fr\": \"Ce flux de travail montre comment l\'éditeur d\'entrée peut être utilisé pour créer des formulaires personnalisés.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-10-07 13:46:05','2025-10-07 13:46:05'),(1582,117,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"text\": \"Yes\", \"value\": \"yes\"}, {\"text\": \"No\", \"value\": \"no\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Have you had a Canada passport before?\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-07 13:53:53','2025-10-07 13:53:53'),(1584,123,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You can pay extra for an appointment at a passport office if you need it urgently\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": \"\\tUsually within 3 weeks - it will be delivered securely to your home. £94.50 (or £107.50 for a 54-page frequent traveller passport)\", \"text\": \"Standard\", \"value\": \"1\"}, {\"hint\": \"Delivered by courier to your home 1 week after the appointment.  £178 (or £191 for a 54-page frequent traveller passport)\", \"text\": \"1 week Fast Track\", \"value\": \"2\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect it 4 hours after your appointment. £222 (or £235 for a 54-page frequent traveller passport) \", \"text\": \"1-day Premium\", \"value\": \"3\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Do you need a passport urgently?\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-07 13:59:20','2025-10-07 13:59:20'),(1587,102,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"The Nine Walkers, also called the Fellowship of the Ring, were chosen in Rivendell to counter the Nine Riders of Sauron and to bear the One Ring toward its destruction in Mordor. They were a company of diverse peoples, representing the Free Peoples of Middle-earth: Frodo Baggins the Ring-bearer, Samwise Gamgee his loyal companion, Merry Brandybuck and Pippin Took his cousins, Gandalf the wizard, Aragorn the ranger and heir of Isildur, Legolas the elf, Gimli the dwarf, and Boromir of Gondor. Their task was not to fight armies but to support Frodo’s perilous journey into the heart of enemy territory. The Fellowship embodied unity across races long divided, but as their path grew darker, their bonds were tested, and the company ultimately fractured, setting each member on different but interconnected courses in the War of the Ring.\", \"fr\": \"Les Neuf Compagnons, également appelés la Fraternité de l\'Anneau, ont été choisis à Rivendell pour contrer les Neuf Cavaliers de Sauron et porter l\'Anneau vers sa destruction à Mordor. Ils étaient une compagnie de divers peuples, représentant les Libres Peuples de Terre du Milieu : Frodo Baggins, le porteur de l\'Anneau, Samwise Gamgee son compagnon fidèle, Merry Brandybuck et Peregrin Took ses cousins, Gandalf le magicien, Aragorn le ranger et héritier d\'Isildur, Legolas l\'elfe, Gimli l\'nain, et Boromir de Gondor. Leur tâche n\'était pas de combattre des armées mais de soutenir le voyage périlleux de Frodo vers le cœur du territoire ennemi. La Fraternité incarnait l\'unité across races long divisées, mais comme leur chemin s\'est rendu plus sombre, leurs liens ont été mis à l\'épreuve, et la compagnie a finalement été divisée, faisant chacun membre partir sur des chemins différents mais interconnectés dans la Guerre du Cercle.\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"text\": {\"en\": \"Frodo Baggins\", \"fr\": \"Frodo Baggins\"}, \"value\": \"frodo\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Samwise Gamgee\", \"fr\": \"Samwise Gamgee\"}, \"value\": \"sam\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Meriadoc Brandybuck\", \"fr\": \"Meriadoc Brandybuck\"}, \"value\": \"merry\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Peregrin Took\", \"fr\": \"Peregrin Took\"}, \"value\": \"pippin\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Gandalf\", \"fr\": \"Gandalf\"}, \"value\": \"gandalf\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Aragorn\", \"fr\": \"Aragorn\"}, \"value\": \"aragorn\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Legolas Greenleaf\", \"fr\": \"Legolas Greenleaf\"}, \"value\": \"legolas\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Gimli\", \"fr\": \"Gimli\"}, \"value\": \"gimli\"}, {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Boromir\", \"fr\": \"Boromir\"}, \"value\": \"boromir\"}], \"props\": {\"mode\": \"static\", \"endpoint\": null, \"attributes\": null}, \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Chose a member of the fellowship\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez un membre de la fraternité\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-08 13:45:55','2025-10-08 13:45:55'),(1588,102,2,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio-2\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"You can only choose one\", \"fr\": \"Vous ne pouvez en choisir qu’un\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio-2\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Elven refuge in the Misty Mountains\", \"fr\": \"Refuge elfique dans les Monts Brumeux\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Rivendell\", \"fr\": \"Fondcombe\"}, \"value\": \"rivendell\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Land of the Dark Lord Sauron\", \"fr\": \"Terre du Seigneur des Ténèbres Sauron\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Mordor\", \"fr\": \"Mordor\"}, \"value\": \"mordor\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Hobbit homeland in the northwest of Middle-earth\", \"fr\": \"Patrie des Hobbits dans le nord-ouest de la Terre du Milieu\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"The Shire\", \"fr\": \"La Comté\"}, \"value\": \"shire\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Land of the horse-lords\", \"fr\": \"Terre des seigneurs des chevaux\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Rohan\", \"fr\": \"Rohan\"}, \"value\": \"rohan\"}, {\"hint\": {\"en\": \"Kingdom of Men near Mordor\", \"fr\": \"Royaume des Hommes près de Mordor\"}, \"text\": {\"en\": \"Gondor\", \"fr\": \"Gondor\"}, \"value\": \"gondor\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Choose an option\", \"fr\": \"Choisissez une option\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-08 13:45:55','2025-10-08 13:45:55'),(1595,76,1,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"Consent Form\", \"fr\": \"Formulaire de consentement\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-heading-l\"}','2025-10-08 20:47:29','2025-10-08 20:47:29'),(1596,76,2,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-2\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-2\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"By proceeding, I give my expressed and informed consent to the Native Women’s Association of Canada and/or its sub-agreement holders to the Indigenous Skills and Employment Training Program (hereinafter referred to as ISET), to collect personal or sensitive information as it relates to my request for funding under the ISET program funded by Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC). My consent extends to providing my Social Insurance Number (SIN), to determine my eligibility for interventions such as skills training and wage subsidies as part of the Labour Market Development Agreements (LMDA) program.\", \"fr\": \"En poursuivant, je donne mon consentement explicite et informé à l\'Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et/ou ses titulaires de sous-conventions de l\'Programme d\'emploi et de développement des compétences autochtones (ici désigné par ISET), pour collecter des informations personnelles ou sensibles au titre de ma demande de financement du programme ISET financé par Employment and Social Development Canada (ESDC). Mon consentement s\'étend à la fourniture de mon numéro de sécurité sociale (SIN), pour déterminer ma qualification à des interventions telles que la formation en compétences et les subventions salariales dans le cadre du Programme d\'accords sur le développement du marché du travail (LMDA).\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-10-08 20:47:29','2025-10-08 20:47:29'),(1597,76,3,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-3\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-3\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"I acknowledge that the information is collected and administered in accordance with the Privacy Act (R.S.C. 1985, c P-21), the Department Employment and Social Development Canada Act (S.C. 2005, c.34), and the Access to Information Act (R.S.C., 1985, c.A-1). Information collected is to be used to determine eligibility for the ISET program; to measure results of this Agreement and evaluate its success; evaluate the effectiveness of the Program in achieving its objective; and, to meet its obligations of accountability by reporting on the results of the Program.\", \"fr\": \"Je reconnais que l\'information est collectée et gérée en vertu de la Loi sur la vie privée (R.S.C. 1985, c P-21), de la Loi sur le ministère de l\'emploi et du développement social du Canada (S.C. 2005, c.34), et de la Loi sur l\'accès à l\'information (R.S.C., 1985, c.A-1). L\'information est destinée à déterminer la qualification à ISET; à mesurer les résultats de ce contrat et à évaluer son succès; évaluer l\'efficacité du Programme dans atteinte de son objectif; et, à satisfaire ses obligations d\'accountabilité en rapportant les résultats du Programme.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-10-08 20:47:29','2025-10-08 20:47:29'),(1598,76,4,29,'{\"id\": \"text-block-4\", \"html\": \"\", \"name\": \"text-block-4\", \"text\": {\"en\": \"All information referred to above shall be treated as confidential, and the Native Women’s Association of Canada and its sub-agreement holders will take all security measures reasonably necessary for the protection of such information against unauthorized release or disclosure.\", \"fr\": \"Toute information mentionnée ci-dessus sera traitée comme confidentielle, et l\'Association des femmes autochtones du Canada et ses titulaires de sous-conventions prendront toutes mesures de sécurité raisonnables nécessaires pour la protection de cette information contre une divulgation ou une révélation non autorisée.\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-body\"}','2025-10-08 20:47:29','2025-10-08 20:47:29'),(1599,76,5,35,'{\"id\": \"applicant_signature\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"I confirm that I have read and understood the above consent and agree to proceed with my application.\", \"fr\": \"Je confirme avoir lu et compris le consentement ci-dessus et j\'accepte de poursuivre ma demande.\"}}, \"name\": \"consent\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Consent\", \"fr\": \"Signer avant de procéder\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"required\": true, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"boxPadding\": \"m\", \"clearLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Clear\", \"fr\": \"Effacer\"}}, \"actionLabel\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Sign Now\", \"fr\": \"Signer Maintenant\"}}, \"placeholder\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"First Name Last Name\", \"fr\": \"Prénom Nom\"}}, \"handwritingFont\": \"cursive\", \"statusSignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Signed\", \"fr\": \"Signé\"}}, \"statusUnsignedText\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Unsigned\", \"fr\": \"Non signé\"}}}','2025-10-08 20:47:29','2025-10-08 20:47:29'),(1603,124,1,1,'{\"id\": \"example-radio\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Please select the service you are seeking an appointment for.  You will be taken to a list of the closest visa applications centres to you.\"}}, \"name\": \"example-radio\", \"items\": [{\"hint\": \"Submit new or renewal passport applications\", \"text\": \"Passport Application\", \"value\": \"passport_application\", \"conditionalChildId\": \"example-input\"}, {\"hint\": \"Submit visa applications for various countries\", \"text\": \"Visa Application Submission\", \"value\": \"visa_application_submission\"}, {\"hint\": \"Fingerprint and photograph collection\", \"text\": \"Biometric Collection\", \"value\": \"biometric_collection\"}, {\"hint\": \"Verification of application documents\", \"text\": \"Document Verification\", \"value\": \"document_verification\"}, {\"hint\": \"Book appointments for visa interviews\", \"text\": \"Interview Scheduling\", \"value\": \"interview_scheduling\"}, {\"hint\": \"Check status of submitted applications\", \"text\": \"Application Status Tracking\", \"value\": \"application_status_tracking\"}, {\"hint\": \"Receive passports after processing\", \"text\": \"Passport Delivery\", \"value\": \"passport_delivery\"}, {\"hint\": \"On-site photograph for applications\", \"text\": \"Photo Capture\", \"value\": \"photo_capture\"}, {\"hint\": \"Help with completing application forms\", \"text\": \"Form Filling Assistance\", \"value\": \"form_filling_assistance\"}, {\"hint\": \"Make payments for application fees\", \"text\": \"Payment Processing\", \"value\": \"payment_processing\"}, {\"hint\": \"Guidance about visa and passport procedures\", \"text\": \"Information Counselling\", \"value\": \"information_counselling\"}, {\"hint\": \"Schedule visits to the centre\", \"text\": \"Appointment Booking\", \"value\": \"appointment_booking\"}, {\"hint\": \"Return of original documents after verification\", \"text\": \"Document Return Service\", \"value\": \"document_return_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Issue of emergency travel documents\", \"text\": \"Emergency Passport Service\", \"value\": \"emergency_passport_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Translation of documents if required\", \"text\": \"Translation Services\", \"value\": \"translation_services\"}, {\"hint\": \"Notarizing documents for official use\", \"text\": \"Notarization Services\", \"value\": \"notarization_services\"}, {\"hint\": \"Assistance and queries handling\", \"text\": \"Customer Support\", \"value\": \"customer_support\"}, {\"hint\": \"Medical checks required for some visa types\", \"text\": \"Health Screening\", \"value\": \"health_screening\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect vaccination records relevant to visa\", \"text\": \"Vaccination Collection\", \"value\": \"vaccination_collection\"}, {\"hint\": \"Courier delivery of documents and passports\", \"text\": \"Courier Service\", \"value\": \"courier_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Assistance with data entry for applications\", \"text\": \"Data Entry Service\", \"value\": \"data_entry_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Confirm applicant identity through documents\", \"text\": \"Identity Verification\", \"value\": \"identity_verification\"}, {\"hint\": \"Legal advice related to visa applications\", \"text\": \"Legal Advisory\", \"value\": \"legal_advisory\"}, {\"hint\": \"Digitizing application documents\", \"text\": \"Document Scanning\", \"value\": \"document_scanning\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect applicant fingerprints\", \"text\": \"Fingerprint Capture\", \"value\": \"fingerprint_capture\"}, {\"hint\": \"Capture iris biometric data\", \"text\": \"Iris Scan\", \"value\": \"iris_scan\"}, {\"hint\": \"Collect voice biometric data\", \"text\": \"Voice Recognition\", \"value\": \"voice_recognition\"}, {\"hint\": \"Conduct background verification\", \"text\": \"Background Check Service\", \"value\": \"background_check_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Reminders for scheduled appointments\", \"text\": \"Appointment Reminder Service\", \"value\": \"appointment_reminder_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Faster processing of applications\", \"text\": \"Express Service\", \"value\": \"express_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Support for group visa applications\", \"text\": \"Group Application Service\", \"value\": \"group_application_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Specialized support for student visas\", \"text\": \"Student Visa Service\", \"value\": \"student_visa_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Assistance with work permit applications\", \"text\": \"Work Permit Service\", \"value\": \"work_permit_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Advice on immigration options\", \"text\": \"Immigration Consultation\", \"value\": \"immigration_consultation\"}, {\"hint\": \"Certification of documents\", \"text\": \"Document Authentication\", \"value\": \"document_authentication\"}, {\"hint\": \"Information and purchase of travel insurance\", \"text\": \"Travel Insurance Service\", \"value\": \"travel_insurance_service\"}, {\"hint\": \"Certified translations for official use\", \"text\": \"Translation Certification\", \"value\": \"translation_certification\"}], \"classes\": \"govuk-radios\", \"disabled\": false, \"fieldset\": {\"legend\": {\"text\": \"Which service do you require\", \"classes\": \"govuk-fieldset__legend--l\", \"isPageHeading\": false}}, \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}}','2025-10-08 21:01:35','2025-10-08 21:01:35'),(1604,124,2,26,'{\"id\": \"example-input\", \"hint\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Enter the requested value.\"}}, \"mask\": \"\", \"name\": \"example-input\", \"type\": \"text\", \"label\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"Please enter your passport number\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-label--m\"}, \"value\": {\"en\": \"\"}, \"prefix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"suffix\": {\"text\": \"\"}, \"classes\": \"govuk-input\", \"pattern\": \"\", \"formGroup\": {\"classes\": \"\"}, \"inputmode\": \"\", \"spellcheck\": true, \"autocomplete\": \"\", \"errorMessage\": {\"text\": {\"en\": \"\"}}}','2025-10-08 21:01:35','2025-10-08 21:01:35');
